    "name": "The King's Courier",
    "steam_appid": 3555390,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The King's Courier is a medieval delivery simulation game with roguelike elements.</strong> The King is a demanding figure - speed, stategy and careful planning will be required to meet his daily delivery demands. venture through a vibrant, open world as you strive for a 5-star courier rating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555390/extras/e72f1378e1545c26b8d1ede19959eab5.poster.avif?t=1741734844\" width=800 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555390/extras/e72f1378e1545c26b8d1ede19959eab5.webm?t=1741734844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555390/extras/e72f1378e1545c26b8d1ede19959eab5.mp4?t=1741734844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Route planning is key.</strong> Choose a starting point and map out the most efficient path between shops, fields and delivery boxes to ensure all  deliveries are made before sunrise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555390/extras/8c8b5dc9aee2c1a12f82231ba2ab341b.poster.avif?t=1741734844\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555390/extras/8c8b5dc9aee2c1a12f82231ba2ab341b.webm?t=1741734844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555390/extras/8c8b5dc9aee2c1a12f82231ba2ab341b.mp4?t=1741734844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade and optimise.\u00a0</strong>Purchase upgrades and equipment from the store and get rewarded with cards to help optimise your route. Sometimes swapping a mushroom for a carrot can save time and prevent retracing steps!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555390/extras/f11fab396fa518994004500ce9666c03.poster.avif?t=1741734844\" width=800 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555390/extras/f11fab396fa518994004500ce9666c03.webm?t=1741734844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555390/extras/f11fab396fa518994004500ce9666c03.mp4?t=1741734844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and unlock.\u00a0</strong>New items and locations are added  each day so careful planning is required to keep up with demand. As progression is made, new starting areas become available, ensuring that no two delivery runs are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555390/extras/c7d10f2ff31363ae951d2286ac7aa0f1.poster.avif?t=1741734844\" width=800 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555390/extras/c7d10f2ff31363ae951d2286ac7aa0f1.webm?t=1741734844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555390/extras/c7d10f2ff31363ae951d2286ac7aa0f1.mp4?t=1741734844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional gameplay features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five distinct locations to unlock, each with exclusive items tied to that area.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thirteen different delivery items to find and incorporate into your route.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A huge range of upgrade cards and store purchases available - from courier attributes to larger and faster delivery carts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three ways to play. Master speed, efficiency and endurance to unlock a five star courier rating.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five difficulties to choose from ensure the right level of challenge. &quot;Impossible&quot; really does live up to it's name!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The King's Courier is a medieval delivery simulation game with roguelike elements.</strong> The King is a demanding figure - speed, stategy and careful planning will be required to meet his daily delivery demands. venture through a vibrant, open world as you strive for a 5-star courier rating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555390/extras/e72f1378e1545c26b8d1ede19959eab5.poster.avif?t=1741734844\" width=800 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555390/extras/e72f1378e1545c26b8d1ede19959eab5.webm?t=1741734844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555390/extras/e72f1378e1545c26b8d1ede19959eab5.mp4?t=1741734844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Route planning is key.</strong> Choose a starting point and map out the most efficient path between shops, fields and delivery boxes to ensure all  deliveries are made before sunrise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555390/extras/8c8b5dc9aee2c1a12f82231ba2ab341b.poster.avif?t=1741734844\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555390/extras/8c8b5dc9aee2c1a12f82231ba2ab341b.webm?t=1741734844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555390/extras/8c8b5dc9aee2c1a12f82231ba2ab341b.mp4?t=1741734844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade and optimise.\u00a0</strong>Purchase upgrades and equipment from the store and get rewarded with cards to help optimise your route. Sometimes swapping a mushroom for a carrot can save time and prevent retracing steps!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555390/extras/f11fab396fa518994004500ce9666c03.poster.avif?t=1741734844\" width=800 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555390/extras/f11fab396fa518994004500ce9666c03.webm?t=1741734844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555390/extras/f11fab396fa518994004500ce9666c03.mp4?t=1741734844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and unlock.\u00a0</strong>New items and locations are added  each day so careful planning is required to keep up with demand. As progression is made, new starting areas become available, ensuring that no two delivery runs are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555390/extras/c7d10f2ff31363ae951d2286ac7aa0f1.poster.avif?t=1741734844\" width=800 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555390/extras/c7d10f2ff31363ae951d2286ac7aa0f1.webm?t=1741734844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555390/extras/c7d10f2ff31363ae951d2286ac7aa0f1.mp4?t=1741734844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional gameplay features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five distinct locations to unlock, each with exclusive items tied to that area.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thirteen different delivery items to find and incorporate into your route.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A huge range of upgrade cards and store purchases available - from courier attributes to larger and faster delivery carts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three ways to play. Master speed, efficiency and endurance to unlock a five star courier rating.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five difficulties to choose from ensure the right level of challenge. &quot;Impossible&quot; really does live up to it's name!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Life can be tough as a medieval courier. Explore a colourful environment as you plan your daily deliveries, select cards to help optimise your route and purchase upgrades to increase efficiency!",
